{"id": 16618, "jp_tail": "たのだ。ずっと。", "zh": "然后，道了歉。_n５年间，她一直在等待。_n_r一直。", "score": 88, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 16619, "jp_tail": "病院で――", "zh": "在医院里――", "score": 88, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
